{{Update History Table/row|V0.100.0|
* Reworked '''Doormaker.''' ''Beware.''
** Door mechanic removed. Instead starts the first turn as the door with infinite health then transforms into the Doormaker proper. Has Hunger of the Void: Every 10th card drawn is eaten, giving Doormaker 1 Strength.}}

{{Update History Table/row|v0.102.0|
